      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.68 (vs ₹1.80 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.68 (up from ₹1.80 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.51b (up 30% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹85.3m (up 101% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.7% (up from 3.7% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 121% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 20% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
