      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.51 (up from ₹0.46 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹349.5m (up 444% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹12.1m (up 82% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.5% (down from 10% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 92% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 48% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
